Package: spdf
Type: Package
Title: Read, Search and Cite 'SPDF' Documents
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("José Luis", "Saorín Ferrer", email = "jl@joseluissaorin.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reads, validates, searches, cites and writes 'SPDF' (Semantic
    Processed Document Format) files: documents read once and citable forever,
    stored as 'SQLite' databases in which every passage carries its exact
    anchor (printed page, folio, second of a recording, slide, verse). Opens
    'SPDF' 5.0 and legacy 4.x files safely, returns their parts as tibbles,
    runs the reference lexical (full-text), vector and hybrid searches of the
    specification, builds anchor URIs and author-date citations, exports
    'CSL-JSON' and 'BibTeX', and helps to search and count terms over corpora.
